================================================================================
4. LLM providers
================================================================================

When LLM_PROVIDER is set, gym-tracker sends generated prompts (never user text)
to the configured endpoint:
  - "groq"   -> https://api.groq.com  (OpenAI-compatible)
  - "ollama" -> a self-hosted server at LLM_BASE_URL
  - "openai" -> any OpenAI-compatible endpoint at LLM_BASE_URL (OpenRouter,
               Cerebras, Google Gemini's compat path, a self-hosted vLLM, ...)

gym-tracker does not bundle any model. Model weights and API terms belong to the
respective providers.


================================================================================
5. Fonts
================================================================================

The UI uses the viewer's system fonts. The CSS font stack names "Vazirmatn"
(SIL Open Font License 1.1) as a preferred face for Persian text; the font is
not bundled and is only used if already present on the viewer's system.
